-- The ticket buying cluster: one pillar (Ticket Buying Guide) and eight guides, each 3,600 words or more, with images (alt text), internal links to the
-- rest of the cluster and the site, official external sources, FAQ data and a live listings block. Written to rank for low-difficulty, high-volume
-- questions (see docs/seo/top-15-pages.md). Idempotent: re-running updates the same slugs.

